## al-01-why: every X_eTaL line the video shows, run at the pinned commit.
## just eval prints what the video shows under each line.

## double: two times values (scene "double")
values := 1 2 3 4
2 * values
## 2 4 6 8

## spellings: the same doubling, the line the other languages are shown beside
2 * 1 2 3 4
## 2 4 6 8

## typed-drawn and pipeline: reduce by plus
'+ r_/ 1 2 3 4
## 10

## hundred: the same line for a hundred values (2 4 6 ... 198 200)
2 * r_ange 100

## reduce: reduce given times
'* r_/ 1 2 3 4
## 24
